      "message": "We also shared the Socket ID with host app through System API. The host app can do OOB communication with the corresponding offload app using Socket ID when socket connection and data path switch is completed.\n\nhttps://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Bluetooth/+/3349374/22/framework/java/android/bluetooth/BluetoothSocket.java#1141\n\nCurrently, stack layer (i.e., BTIF socket) also needs to map the Socket ID to corresponding BTIF socket structure.",
      "parentUuid": "e2734326_78621927",
      "revId": "c79bff834f9db95578aa5b5ced5fdfb4684e3b36",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
